# Phase 3

The binding spec is `docs/phases/phase-3/phase-3-scope.md`. The step list is `docs/phases/phase-3/phase-3-status.md`. The stages are `api-live-catalog`, `api-live-exam`, `api-live-roster`, `api-live-sitting`, and `api-live-evaluation`. Do not start a stage until the previous stage's exit passes.

The earlier stages `api-exam-module` through `api-question-bank` are superseded. Do not extend them. Do not treat their exits as proof of the live-exam rules.

## API only

This phase is `api/` plus its `*IT` classes. Do not add exam screens under `mobile/` or `web/`. Do not open a browser, install an emulator, or run a device check. Automated checks only, against real PostgreSQL. Do not use H2. Do not add a mobile or web CI workflow.

Before writing a stage, read that stage's plan, test list, and rule in `api/.cursor/`. Also read `api/.cursor/rules/api-exam-invariants.mdc`.

## Stay inside the phase

Reuse Phase 1 delete and activation conventions. A new `INSTRUCTOR` role uses the System Admin create-and-activate path. Do not redesign passwords. Do not put an exam node on a course content tree. Do not add a payment gateway, attendance, notices, or batches.

New exam tables start at Flyway `V24`. Do not alter `V14`–`V23` to impersonate this model. Package: `com.coachingcenter.api.exams`.
